			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000b">01 — THE WATERSHED</p>
		
</div>
			<h1 data-interaction-id="e0000c" class="e-ykrhga-e0000c-s e-heading-base">We buy the river back, one field at a time.</h1>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000d">Common Ground Trust holds 4,180 acres along the Wenn valley in permanent trust. Not managed, not leased. <strong>Bought outright, protected forever</strong>, and opened to anyone who can walk to it.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000e-s " data-id="e0000e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000e">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000f"><a href="#standing-order" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Protect an acre
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000g"><a href="#parcels" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Read the three dossiers
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000h-s " data-id="e0000h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000h">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000i">Every boundary on this map is a Land Registry title we hold or an offer we have made. Nothing on it is aspirational.</p>
		
