</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000w-s " data-id="e0000w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000w">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000x-s " data-id="e0000x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000y-s " data-id="e0000y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000z-s " data-id="e0000z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000z">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00010-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00010">02 — THE LEDGER, THIS MORNING</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00011 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00011-s " data-id="e00011" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00011">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00012 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00012-s " data-id="e00012" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00012">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00013-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00013">4,180</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00014-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00014">ACRES HELD</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00015-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00015">Bought outright and held in permanent trust. None of it can be sold, and none of it has been.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00016 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00016-s " data-id="e00016" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00016">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00017-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00017">217</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00018-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00018">ACRES UNDER OFFER</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00019-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00019">Three parcels. Contracts drawn, deposits down, money still short on all three.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001a-s " data-id="e0001a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001b">96</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001c">ACRES LOST THIS YEAR</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001d">Lost to development while we were raising the money. Outline consent granted in March; we were 140,000 short in February.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001e-s " data-id="e0001e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001e">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001f">The third number is the reason for the first two. <em>Land goes when the money is slow.</em></p>
		
</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001g-s " data-id="e0001g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001g" id="parcels">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001h-s " data-id="e0001h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001h">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001i-s " data-id="e0001i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001i">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001j-s " data-id="e0001j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001j">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001k">03 — UNDER OFFER NOW</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001l e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0001l-s " data-id="e0001l" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001l">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0001m" class="e-ykrhga-e0001m-s e-heading-base">The three we are trying to buy now.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001n">Each one is a signed offer against a real title. The money raised sits in a restricted account and is spent on that parcel or returned. Numbers below were true at 06:00 today.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001o-s " data-id="e0001o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001p-s " data-id="e0001p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001p">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001q e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0001q-s " data-id="e0001q" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0001q">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001r-s " data-id="e0001r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001r">
    		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001s elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="e0001s" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
					
<svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="Sketch plan of the parcel" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;background:#F3F5EF">
  <rect width="120" height="120" fill="#F3F5EF"/>
  <line x1="40" y1="0" x2="40" y2="120" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1"/>
  <line x1="80" y1="0" x2="80" y2="120" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1"/>
