</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003i">04 — WHAT THE MONEY BUYS</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003j e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0003j-s " data-id="e0003j" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0003j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003k-s " data-id="e0003k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003k">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0003l" class="e-ykrhga-e0003l-s e-heading-base">Twelve pounds a month, in square metres.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003m">12 pounds a month protects roughly <strong>40 square metres a year</strong>, and keeps protecting it after you stop.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003n">That is the whole arithmetic. Land in the Wenn valley runs at about 6,500 an acre; a standing order becomes a deposit, a deposit becomes a contract, and the contract does not lapse when your circumstances change.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003o-s " data-id="e0003o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003p e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0003p-s " data-id="e0003p" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0003p">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003q">£6</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003r">20 m²</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003s">a hedge bottom</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003t e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0003t-s " data-id="e0003t" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0003t">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003u">£12</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003v">40 m²</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003w">a curlew’s nest scrape and the grass round it</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003x e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0003x-s " data-id="e0003x" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0003x">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003y">£25</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003z">83 m²</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00040-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00040">a spring line and the flush below it</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00041 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00041-s " data-id="e00041" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00041">
