ll-opacity="0.42" stroke="#6E8B3D" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="208" y="132" width="32" height="32" fill="#6E8B3D" fill-opacity="0.42" stroke="#6E8B3D" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="246" y="132" width="32" height="32" fill="#6E8B3D" fill-opacity="0.42" stroke="#6E8B3D" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="284" y="132" width="32" height="32" fill="#6E8B3D" fill-opacity="0.42" stroke="#6E8B3D" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="322" y="132" width="32" height="32" fill="#6E8B3D" fill-opacity="0.42" stroke="#6E8B3D" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="360" y="132" width="32" height="32" fill="#6E8B3D" fill-opacity="0.42" stroke="#6E8B3D" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="18" y="170" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="56" y="170" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="94" y="170" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="132" y="170" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="170" y="170" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="208" y="170" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="246" y="170" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="284" y="170" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="322" y="170" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="360" y="170" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="18" y="208" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="56" y="208" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="94" y="208" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="132" y="208" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="170" y="208" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="208" y="208" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="246" y="208" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="284" y="208" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="322" y="208" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="360" y="208" width="32" height="32" fill="#F3F5EF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1.4"/>
  <line x1="18" y1="258" x2="402" y2="258" stroke="#C9D1C2" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text x="18" y="280" font-family="'Source Sans 3', sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#1B2A20" letter-spacing="0.8">40 m² PROTECTED, ONE YEAR OF £12 A MONTH</text>
  <text x="402" y="280" text-anchor="end" font-family="'Source Sans 3', sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#C4913C">1 square = 1 m²</text>
</svg>				</div>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00048-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00048">Forty square metres is a curlew’s nest scrape and the tussocks a chick hides in for its first fortnight. It is not a symbol. It is the actual area.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00049 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00049-s " data-id="e00049" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00049">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004a e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0004a-s " data-id="e0004a" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0004a">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004b-s " data-id="e0004b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004b">
    			<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0004c-s" data-interaction-id="e0004c" id="71" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-commonground-trust-curlew.jpg" width="512" height="512" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-commonground-trust-curlew.jpg 512w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-commonground-trust-curlew-300x300.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-commonground-trust-curlew-150x150.jpg 150w" alt="A curlew standing in wet meadow grass on the Wenn floodplain"/>		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004d-s " data-id="e0004d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004d">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004e-s " data-id="e0004e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004f-s " data-id="e0004f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004f">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004g">05 — CAME BACK, WITH DATES</p>
		
</div>
			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0004h" class="e-ykrhga-e0004h-s e-heading-base">What returned, and the year it did.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004i">Volunteers walk fixed transects four times a year. These are their records, not our claims — the raw survey sheets go up every December.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004j-s " data-id="e0004j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004k-s " data-id="e0004k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004l-s " data-id="e0004l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004l">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004m" class="e-ykrhga-e0004m-s e-heading-base">Curlew</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004n">2023</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004o">Ash Carr</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004p">Returned after nineteen years absent. Two pairs in 2023, five in 2025, all on ground we stopped being mown in May.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004q-s " data-id="e0004q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004q">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004r-s " data-id="e0004r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004r">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004s" class="e-ykrhga-e0004s-s e-heading-base">Water vole</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004t">2025</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004u">Wenn, Marsden reach</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004v">Recorded on four kilometres of bank. The mink raft survey found nothing for the third year running.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004w-s " data-id="e0004w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004w">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004x-s " data-id="e0004x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004x">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004y" class="e-ykrhga-e0004y-s e-heading-base">Otter</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004z">Winter 2025</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00050-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00050">Whole valley</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00051-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00051">Spraint found at every survey point last winter — twenty-two points, twenty-two positives.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00052 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00052-s " data-id="e00052" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00052">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00053 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00053-s " data-id="e00053" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00053">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e00054-s" data-interaction-id="e00054" id="73" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-commonground-trust-volunteer_survey.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-commonground-trust-volunteer_survey.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-commonground-trust-volunteer_survey-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-commonground-trust-volunteer_survey-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="Volunteers carrying out a bank survey along the river"/>		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00055-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00055">Sixty-one volunteers, twenty-two survey points, four visits a year. Nobody is paid to count.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00056 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00056-s " data-id="e00056" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00056">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00057 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00057-s " data-id="e00057" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00057">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00058 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00058-s " data-id="e00058" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00058">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00059 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00059-s " data-id="e00059" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00059">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005a">06 — TWO OTHER WAYS</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005b e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0005b-s " data-id="e0005b" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005b">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0005c" class="e-ykrhga-e0005c-s e-heading-base">Leave land, not just money.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005d">Roughly a third of the map above arrived this way. Neither path costs you anything while you are alive to enjoy the ground.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005e e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0005e-s " data-id="e0005e" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005f-s " data-id="e0005f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005f">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005g">PATH A</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005h" class="e-ykrhga-e0005h-s e-heading-base">A bequest</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005i">Leave us the land, or leave us the money to buy it.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005j-s " data-id="e0005j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005k-s " data-id="e0005k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005k">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005l">01</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005m">Tell your solicitor the charity number: 0000001.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005n-s " data-id="e0005n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005n">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005o">02</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005p">Name the parcel if you have one in mind, or leave it open and we will buy where the river needs it most.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005q-s " data-id="e0005q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005q">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005r">03</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005s">Land left to us is never resold. It goes into the same permanent trust as everything on the map above.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005t">We will talk to your executors, your family, and your farm agent, for as long as it takes.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005u-s " data-id="e0005u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005u">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005v">PATH B</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005w" class="e-ykrhga-e0005w-s e-heading-base">A conservation easement</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005x">Keep your land. Give up the right to ruin it.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005y-s " data-id="e0005y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005z-s " data-id="e0005z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005z">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00060-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00060">01</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00061-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00061">You stay the owner and you keep farming it.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00062 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00062-s " data-id="e00062" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00062">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00063-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00063">02</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00064-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00064">A covenant registered against the title removes the development and drainage rights, permanently.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00065 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00065-s " data-id="e00065" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00065">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00066-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00066">03</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00067-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00067">We monitor it once a year, in person, and the covenant binds every owner after you.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00068-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00068">Four Wenn farms have done this since 2019. Two of them are still in the same families.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00069 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00069-s " data-id="e00069" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00069">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006a"><a href="mailto:land@commongroundtrust.example?subject=Bequest%20or%20easement" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Talk to us about land
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006b">One person answers that address. She has walked every parcel on the map.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006c-s " data-id="e0006c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006c" id="accounts">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006d-s " data-id="e0006d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006d">
